{
    "title": "Number Match - Merge Puzzle",
    "description": "Number Match exciting gameplay and simple mechanics, this great merge number puzzle offers an exciting and entertaining experience for players of all ages.\r\n\r\nThe main objective of the game is to follow and match higher numbers by connecting same numbered blocks. Starting with the number two, you can increase your score by going from number to number, and multiply your score with each block move. \r\n\r\nMerge all the blocks and beat your own best score. Beyond matching numbers, it's about using your strategic thinking and problem-solving skills to make more combos and win more points.\r\n\r\nThe game's sliding and smooth controls make it easy and enjoyable to play, allowing players to merge more numbers and win more combos with each move. You'll need to use your wits to make smart moves and reach the highest score in a single merge from the whole board. But good news for you there is no time limit, so take your time and make the right decisions with every match.\r\n\r\nWith the auto-save feature, you can play wherever you want without the need for an Internet connection and continue to match.\r\n\r\nAs you progress, you'll need to match greater numbers at each step, challenging your memory, concentration levels, and reflexes. But the colorful graphics and simple controls will keep you engaged and entertained as you train your brain with excellent mechanics.\r\n\r\nWith its addictive gameplay, colorful graphics, and challenging levels, it is sure to become your new favorite puzzle game. So start to matching now and collect the scores.\r\n\r\nGame Features\r\n- Easy to learn\r\n- Simple controls\r\n- No time limits\r\n- Colorful & shiny graphic design\r\n- Automatic save game",
    "descriptionHTML": "Number Match exciting gameplay and simple mechanics, this great merge number puzzle offers an exciting and entertaining experience for players of all ages.<br><br>The main objective of the game is to follow and match higher numbers by connecting same numbered blocks. Starting with the number two, you can increase your score by going from number to number, and multiply your score with each block move. <br><br>Merge all the blocks and beat your own best score. Beyond matching numbers, it&#39;s about using your strategic thinking and problem-solving skills to make more combos and win more points.<br><br>The game&#39;s sliding and smooth controls make it easy and enjoyable to play, allowing players to merge more numbers and win more combos with each move. You&#39;ll need to use your wits to make smart moves and reach the highest score in a single merge from the whole board. But good news for you there is no time limit, so take your time and make the right decisions with every match.<br><br>With the auto-save feature, you can play wherever you want without the need for an Internet connection and continue to match.<br><br>As you progress, you&#39;ll need to match greater numbers at each step, challenging your memory, concentration levels, and reflexes. But the colorful graphics and simple controls will keep you engaged and entertained as you train your brain with excellent mechanics.<br><br>With its addictive gameplay, colorful graphics, and challenging levels, it is sure to become your new favorite puzzle game. So start to matching now and collect the scores.<br><br>Game Features<br>- Easy to learn<br>- Simple controls<br>- No time limits<br>- Colorful &amp; shiny graphic design<br>- Automatic save game",
